<http://data.silknow.org/object/27934fc2-fd34-301c-893d-7e21e6afb466/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Cushion made like a book with a spine and two, thickly padded covers.\n\nThe cushion is of pink silk embroidered with an all over pattern of scrolling, interlacing stems enclosing flowers in couched silver thread. In the centres of each cover, the arms of Sandys are enclosed by a laurel wreath embroidered with silver thread, silver gilt thread and with red and black thread. It is lined with white silk."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/27934fc2-fd34-301c-893d-7e21e6afb466> .

